---
import FarmLayout from '../../layouts/FarmLayout.astro';
---

<FarmLayout
  title="Terms & Farm Conditions | Farm Direct Gwalior"
  description="Transparent terms of service for raw agricultural pre-orders, neighbourhood delivery, and free sample tasting in Gwalior."
  canonicalPath="/farm/terms"
>
  <div class="fd-container py-12 sm:py-16 max-w-4xl">
    <div class="mb-8">
      <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-[#c48a3f] font-bold bg-[#fdf6ec] px-3 py-1 rounded-full">
        Fair Trade & Agricultural Agreement
      </span>
      <h1 class="fd-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-[#152317] mt-3">
        Terms & Conditions
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#536354] mt-2">
        Direct-to-consumer farm produce terms for Pawan Nagar, Chetakpuri, and surrounding Gwalior clusters.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-white p-6 sm:p-10 rounded-2xl border border-[#e0e8dc] shadow-sm space-y-8 text-sm text-[#3b473c] leading-relaxed">
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="fd-serif text-xl font-bold text-[#152317]">1. Nature of Raw Agricultural Produce</h2>
        <p>
          Farm Direct supplies authentic, unprocessed, raw agricultural commodities harvested from village farmland near Gwalior:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
          <li>
            <strong>Minimal Processing:</strong> Our grains (wheat), pulses (chana, moong, urad), and oilseeds (groundnut) are naturally cleaned and threshed. They are <em>not</em> chemically bleached, machine-polished, coated with talc, or treated with synthetic shelf-life extenders.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Natural Harvest Variation:</strong> As pure agricultural harvests, grain size, husk shade, and texture naturally vary across fields and seasons. A customary rinse and sun-drying before household milling or cooking is recommended.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="fd-serif text-xl font-bold text-[#152317]">2. The Pre-Order & Cluster Delivery Model</h2>
        <p>
          To maintain farm gate pricing without intermediary wholesale cuts or unsold food waste, we operate strictly on a <strong>pre-order batching schedule</strong>:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
          <li>Customers place orders throughout the week.</li>
          <li>Produce is weighed, bagged in durable eco-sacks, and loaded onto consolidated transport vehicles.</li>
          <li>Deliveries are dispatched on scheduled cluster days (typically Sunday mornings for Pawan Nagar and Chetakpuri).</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="fd-serif text-xl font-bold text-[#152317]">3. Pricing, Weights & Payment</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
          <li>
            <strong>Live Rates:</strong> Prices are displayed clearly in ₹ per kilogram and are calculated accurately based on selected weight presets (1 kg, 5 kg, 10 kg, 25 kg).
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Authoritative Database:</strong> Prices and available inventory are validated server-side on our Cloudflare D1 database.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Pay on Delivery:</strong> Customers pay upon physical delivery at their doorstep. We accept Cash or Direct UPI scan (PhonePe, Google Pay, Paytm) to our farm account.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="fd-serif text-xl font-bold text-[#152317]">4. Cancellations & Modifications</h2>
        <p>
          Pre-orders may be cancelled anytime prior to vehicle dispatch by contacting us on WhatsApp (+91 8770767272). When an order is cancelled, reserved stock is automatically returned to available neighbourhood inventory.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="fd-serif text-xl font-bold text-[#152317]">5. Free Sample Policy</h2>
        <p>
          We offer complimentary 100g or 200g sample packets to let households test our grain quality before placing bulk orders:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
          <li>Sample packets are 100% free with no delivery fee during scheduled rounds.</li>
          <li>Maximum 2 sample packets per customer per delivery round.</li>
          <li>Maximum 1 sample packet per produce variety per household.</li>
          <li>A 14-day cooldown period applies between sample requests for the same commodity.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="fd-serif text-xl font-bold text-[#152317]">6. Contact & Grievance Redressal</h2>
        <p>
          For any questions regarding your harvest bag or delivery timing, reach out directly to the farm coordinator via WhatsApp at <strong>+91 8770767272</strong> or email <a href="mailto:admin@farmdirect.gwalior" class="text-[#275629] font-bold hover:underline">admin@farmdirect.gwalior</a>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</FarmLayout>
